Speaking of puns, since Ben brought it up...

Something about the tanru discussion wasn't quite right, and it was left 
up to Ben to write and therefore right the mistake. While he had every 
right to remind everyone it was left, was it right to do so? Those on 
the Left may think so, but the Right might disagree. All right, I 
realize that this is quite enough. But with no puns, what humor is left?

Ouch, it may be a good thing there are no true puns in Lojban. I now 
right myself, after being knocked out of my seat for making horrible jokes.

Cheers,
